From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: steven_mac <dengh5955@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:35:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Read PFS0 packages missing the final filename terminator

Bound filename reads by the PFS0 string table and provide LibHac with a virtual terminated header. Keep package bytes and payload-relative offsets unchanged, while rejecting truncated tables and invalid name offsets. Cover the scanner and storage reader with synthetic fixtures.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#886
Reason: Accept legacy NSZ PFS0 string tables without rewriting owned game packages.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#886

